# 2. Uniforms driven live

This example starts from the cube of [example 1](../02_cube/index.html), subdivided and twisted in its
vertex shader. Its parameters are modified while it runs: the twist, the hue, the speed, the light, and a reset
button. The panel is built by the page from the parameters declared by the program, so that there is no HTML
to write.

