## Build and run

As [example 1](../02_cube/index.html#build-and-run), from `examples/a2-opengl-uniforms/`; on the desktop,
`./build/project --twist 1.2`. The panel exists only on the web: the desktop version takes its settings from
the command line.

| In the address | Effect |
|---|---|
| `controls=twist,hue` | the controls of the panel, in this order |
| `compact=1` | short labels, small panel (for a small frame) |
| `panel=tl`, `tr`, `bl`, `br` | the corner of the panel (default `tr`) |

